{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53982","headline":"句 · 师复","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君自成龙我成道。\n（见明王应山篡《闽都记》卷十九）（按：《闽都记》云：「双峰寺在绥平里，今四都也。\n唐咸通五年，僧师复自小箬双髻峰移建今所焉。\n观察使林衮同业儒同入关，至扬子渡口，师复有出尘之兴，赋诗曰〖略〗。\n浩然而归，卜筑於此。\n观察使李瓒请赐寺额。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}